OL,3,GNEWSA'You cannot tell Titus Salt's
OL,4,Astory without alpacas'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew York has Hamilton, Paris has Les
OL,7,FMiserables and now Bradford has Salt
OL,8,Fthe Musical ` complete with singing
OL,9,Falpacas.
OL,11,FWritten by Maria Mullin and directed by
OL,12,FAnita Adams, it tells the story of Sir
OL,13,FTitus Salt, the 19th Century
OL,14,Findustrialist who created the model
OL,15,Fvillage of Saltaire to house workers at
OL,16,Fhis textile mill on the outskirts of
OL,17,FBradford.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
