OL,3,GNEWSA'You cannot tell Titus Salt's
OL,4,Astory without alpacas'
OL,5,
OL,6,FProduced by theatre company Show Ready,
OL,7,Fit is based, says Mullin, on her love
OL,8,Ffor the village and Salt's remarkable
OL,9,Finfluence on Britain's textile industry
OL,10,F` including alpaca wool, which he
OL,11,Fhelped introduce to the UK.
OL,13,F"You cannot tell this story without
OL,14,Falpacas. If people come and see the
OL,15,Fshow, they may see some comic singing
OL,16,Falpacas," she said.
